# Python Coding Rules & Standards

## General

-   Follow [PEP 8](https://peps.python.org/pep-0008/) for style and [PEP
    257](https://peps.python.org/pep-0257/) for docstrings.
-   Organize code into well-structured modules: `constants/`, `config/`,
    `utils/`, `core/`, `tests/`.

## Rules (Cursor AI)

``` yaml
rules:
  - id: constants-in-correct-file
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "All constants must be declared in the constants/ directory. Use the appropriate file (FinancialConstants.py, Messages.py, NumericConstants.py, StringConstants.py)."
    severity: error

  - id: config-centralized
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "Configuration values must be centralized in config/settings.py (or equivalent) and not hard-coded."
    severity: error

  - id: imports-absolute
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "Avoid relative imports. Use absolute imports for clarity."
    severity: warning

  - id: type-hints
    pattern: "def "
    message: "All functions and methods must include type hints for parameters and return values."
    severity: warning

  - id: docstrings
    pattern: "def "
    message: "Public functions/classes must include a docstring (PEP 257)."
    severity: warning

  - id: logging
    pattern: "print\("
    message: "Use the logging module instead of print statements."
    severity: error

  - id: magic-numbers
    pattern: "[0-9]{2,}"
    message: "Avoid magic numbers; replace with constants (e.g., NumericConstants)."
    severity: warning

  - id: tests-required
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "Every new module must have unit tests under tests/."
    severity: info

  - id: folder-structure-config
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "All configuration must reside under config/."
    severity: error

  - id: folder-structure-constants
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "All constants must reside under constants/ (FinancialConstants.py, Messages.py, NumericConstants.py, StringConstants.py)."
    severity: error

  - id: folder-structure-utils
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "Utility/helper functions must be placed in utils/ package."
    severity: warning

  - id: folder-structure-core
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "Business/domain logic must reside in core/ package."
    severity: warning

  - id: folder-structure-tests
    pattern: ".*"
    message: "All tests must be inside tests/ package, mirroring module structure."
    severity: error
```
